<title>UK: Frankfurt Hypo adds 500 mln marks to Jan 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Frankfurt Hypo adds 500 mln marks to Jan 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Caisse des Depots et Consignations, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURTER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    16.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.47     PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BILLION ON 06.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
